{"id":"A2-L022","title":"Past Simple questions: production and review","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U02","focus":"Past Simple — questions — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Past Simple — questions — produção e revisão","pron":"Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["billfold","vendor","trustworthy","rightful owner","give back","handed","grin","lost wallet","market vendor","old man","forty dollars","family photo","bank card","honest boy","sweet reward","market stall"],"field":"Compras","genre":"Conto e trecho de peça","skill":"Escrita","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 22 · Past Simple questions: production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Past Simple — questions — produção e revisão.","**Pronúncia:** Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/.","**16 palavras novas** (compras).","**Texto do dia:** conto e trecho de peça."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo contar uma história curta e fazer perguntas sobre ela."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["billfold","carteira de notas"],["vendor","vendedor"],["trustworthy","confiável"],["rightful owner","dono de direito"],["give back","devolver"],["handed","entregou"],["grin","sorriso largo"],["lost wallet","lost wallet"],["market vendor","market vendor"],["old man","old man"],["forty dollars","forty dollars"],["family photo","family photo"],["bank card","bank card"],["honest boy","honest boy"],["sweet reward","sweet reward"],["market stall","market stall"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Lost Wallet","paras":["Kai found a wallet at the market. It had a photo, forty dollars and a card. **Did he keep it?** No. **What did he do?** He asked the vendors, **Whose is this?** Nobody knew.","Later, an old man came running. “**Did you find a wallet?**” Kai handed it over. The man smiled and gave Kai a pastry."],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"A reader","gloss":[["vendor","vendedor"],["hand over","entregar"],["wallet","carteira"],["pastry","doce"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Kai found a wallet.","ans":"T","why":"found a wallet."},{"q":"Kai kept the money.","ans":"F","why":"No."},{"q":"The old man gave Kai a pastry.","ans":"T","why":"gave Kai a pastry."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“vendor” means…","opts":["vendedor","cliente","guarda"],"ans":0,"why":"vendor."},{"q":"“hand over” = ?","opts":["entregar","pegar","jogar"],"ans":0,"why":"hand over."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Story questions","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pergunta","Resposta"],"rows":[["**What did Kai find?**","A wallet."],["**Did he keep it?**","No, he didn’t."],["**Who came running?**","An old man."],["**Why did he smile?**","Because Kai returned it."]],"cap":"Story questions"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Perguntas com **who** (sujeito) não usam did: *Who came?*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"What ___ Kai find? (do)","a":"did","why":"did."},{"s":"___ he keep it? (do)","a":"Did","why":"did."},{"s":"Who ___ running? (come)","a":"came","why":"sujeito."},{"s":"Why ___ he smile? (do)","a":"did","why":"did."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["billfold","carteira de notas"],["vendor","vendedor"],["croissant","croissant"],["trustworthy","confiável"],["reward","recompensa"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["it","Did","he","keep"],"ans":"Did he keep it","pt":"Ele ficou com ela?"},{"words":["did","Kai","find","What"],"ans":"What did Kai find","pt":"O que Kai achou?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"billfold","pos":"word","pt":"carteira de notas","ex":"A leather billfold.","expt":"Uma carteira de couro."},{"w":"vendor","pos":"word","pt":"vendedor","ex":"A street vendor.","expt":"Um vendedor de rua."},{"w":"trustworthy","pos":"word","pt":"confiável","ex":"A trustworthy boy.","expt":"Um menino confiável."},{"w":"rightful owner","pos":"word","pt":"dono de direito","ex":"The rightful owner.","expt":"O dono de direito."},{"w":"give back","pos":"word","pt":"devolver","ex":"Give it back.","expt":"Devolva."},{"w":"handed","pos":"word","pt":"entregou","ex":"He handed it over.","expt":"Ele entregou."},{"w":"grin","pos":"word","pt":"sorriso largo","ex":"A big grin.","expt":"Um sorriso largo."},{"w":"lost wallet","pos":"word","pt":"lost wallet","ex":"carteira perdida","expt":"A lost wallet."},{"w":"market vendor","pos":"word","pt":"market vendor","ex":"vendedor da feira","expt":"A market vendor."},{"w":"old man","pos":"word","pt":"old man","ex":"senhor idoso","expt":"An old man."},{"w":"forty dollars","pos":"word","pt":"forty dollars","ex":"quarenta dólares","expt":"Forty dollars."},{"w":"family photo","pos":"word","pt":"family photo","ex":"foto de família","expt":"A family photo."},{"w":"bank card","pos":"word","pt":"bank card","ex":"cartão do banco","expt":"A bank card."},{"w":"honest boy","pos":"word","pt":"honest boy","ex":"menino honesto","expt":"An honest boy."},{"w":"sweet reward","pos":"word","pt":"sweet reward","ex":"recompensa doce","expt":"A sweet reward."},{"w":"market stall","pos":"word","pt":"market stall","ex":"barraca de feira","expt":"A market stall."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What did Kai find?** — O que Kai achou?","**A wallet.** — Uma carteira.","**Did he keep it?** — Ele ficou com ela?","**Absolutely!** — Com certeza!","**Not really.** — Na verdade, não.","**Not at all.** — De jeito nenhum.","**Sort of.** — Mais ou menos."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"cut","pt":"cortar","forms":[["I / you / we / they cut","I cut bread."],["he / she / it cuts","She cuts the paper."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Retelling","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Retelling","lines":[["Ana","What did Kai find?","O que Kai achou?"],["Leo","A wallet.","Uma carteira."],["Ana","Did he keep it?","Ele ficou com ela?"],["Leo","No. He returned it.","Não. Ele devolveu."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/","items":[{"label":"Plural e 3ª pessoa /s/ /z/ /ɪz/","note":"Pratique em voz alta.","words":[]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Retell the story in 3 sentences.","pt":"Reconte.","model":"Kai found a wallet. He asked the vendors. He returned it."},{"q":"Ask 2 questions about it.","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"What did he find? Did he keep it?"},{"q":"Say why he is honest.","pt":"Diga.","model":"He returned the wallet."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 6-line story in the past with questions.","model":"Kai found a wallet at the market. Did he keep it? No. He asked the vendors. Nobody knew. Later, an old man came. Kai handed it over.","checklist":["Usei **passado**","Usei **perguntas**","Sequência clara"],"words":"6 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “billfold” mean?","opts":["vendedor","confiável","carteira de notas"],"ans":2,"why":"**billfold** = carteira de notas."},{"q":"What does “vendor” mean?","opts":["vendedor","croissant","recompensa"],"ans":0,"why":"**vendor** = vendedor."},